    add_compile_options(-std=c2x)  # C23 draft
endif()</p><p><h1>C++23 feature detection</h1>
set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 23)
set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD_REQUIRED ON)
```</p><p><h2>Migration Strategy</h2></p><p><h3>Phase 1: Core Adoption (Completed)</h3>
